<Behavior #profiled-ctrl-flow-runtime apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #execute-semantic-primitives (
      <Statement ?01M0NJZ4N3X8Q6A553YG65YVYB>
      引擎 SHALL 按产品 profile 执行已批准的语义编排原语，并保持 data、fault 与 lifecycle 事实边界。
      </?01M0NJZ4N3X8Q6A553YG65YVYB>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #instant { name = "即时执行" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #memory-primitives (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4N3X8Q6A553YG65YVYC>
              合法 InstantCtrlFlow 使用 Require、Retry、Timeout、ForEach、Parallel、Race 或同步 CallFlow
              </?01M0NJZ4N3X8Q6A553YG65YVYC>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4N3X8Q6A553YG65YVYD>
              runtime 执行 definition
              </?01M0NJZ4N3X8Q6A553YG65YVYD>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4N3X8Q6A553YG65YVYE>
              引擎 SHALL 在单次 invocation 内按规范产生 output、fault 与取消结果
              </?01M0NJZ4N3X8Q6A553YG65YVYE>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
        <Suite #durable { name = "可恢复执行" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #resume-facts (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4N3X8Q6A553YG65YVYF>
              WorkCtrlFlow 或 BPCtrlFlow 在编排原语中挂起或重启
              </?01M0NJZ4N3X8Q6A553YG65YVYF>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4N3X8Q6A553YG65YVYG>
              runtime 从 snapshot 恢复
              </?01M0NJZ4N3X8Q6A553YG65YVYG>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4N3X8Q6A553YG65YVYH>
              引擎 SHALL 复用已持久化的 attempt、deadline、lane、winner 与取消事实，且不得重复已完成 effect
              </?01M0NJZ4N3X8Q6A553YG65YVYH>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
